Z||000000||DXR_DAD||09-06-99||10:33 PM||||It was a nice day today so I got up and started to wash the black beauty. I looked at it and thought... This is a real nice car and I like it, it looks good... BUT the side molding needs replacing bad. Their not even a nice black color any more. I was going to remove them for a good cleaning and just to see how hard it was to remove. I need to know  if the front end on the fascia molding is made on or is it like the rest, and if it is how is it removed? Where is the best place to buy a set of moldings??
Z||000001||mwbackus||09-07-1999||07:39 PM||||The molding on the front facia is usually  not removable(repaint only).  The rest could be removed and either re-painted or replaced with new.  I believe that The Fiero Store has these moldings available.  It is a good idea to get some clip sets also, since you will probably end up breaking a few of these in the removal process.<P>Mike||||reg||
